# Cross-Border product language

This repository is **Cross-Border** — use our own product terms in implementation, CLI messages, and docs.

## Do not add to code or user-facing strings

- Other hosting panels (aaPanel, cPanel, Plesk, etc.)
- Workflow product names used as analogies (n8n, OpenClaw, etc.)
- Cloud vendor names in generic deploy/firewall hints (Tencent, Alibaba Cloud, AWS, GCP, …)

## Use instead

- **panel** / **install card** / **access card** — setup summary with URL and credentials
- **VPS** / **self-host** / **wwwroot layout** — `/www/wwwroot/<site>` on Linux servers
- **cloud security group** / **host firewall** — public access troubleshooting
- **workflow** / **pipeline** / **tool steps** — gateway automation

## OK to name (product integrations)

- Source sites and marketplaces the scraper supports (1688, Taobao, Shopee, …)
- LLM provider IDs users select in Settings (OpenAI, Claude, Qwen, …)

## Env vars

- Prefer `CROSSBORDER_VPS`, `CROSSBORDER_WWWROOT`, `CROSSBORDER_INSTALL_DIR`
- Do not introduce new `*_AAPANEL*` or vendor-specific env names
